   ],
   "text": "nullDC 3 (devcast) is built on reicast 2021-12 and starts with the fpgadc refsw-offline work in 2023-07. refsw grows into refsw2 and the refsw3 refcore, the bit-exact reference for the PowerVR2 hardware work.",
