  {
   "title": "nullDC4Wii, NotDC-PS3 and nullDC4WiiU, 2026",
   "lanes": [
    "nullDC4Wii",
    "NotDC-PS3",
    "nullDC4WiiU"
   ],
   "text": "nullDC4Wii imports nullDCe verbatim (2026-01) and ships about 90 tagged alphas; NotDC-PS3 imports nullDC4Wii (2026-09) and later carries plugs/caiqueAICA, a port of the caique-rtl AICA model. nullDC4WiiU is a git fork of nullDC4Wii at 1459ccb (2026-10-25): from 2026-11-07 a native Wii U (Aroma) port with a GX2 renderer, a JIT with fastmem and a HOME menu, released as v0.800-U1 .. U2.2. It shares no code with nullDC4Wii's own short-lived Wii U attempt (2026-11-13, removed 11-17).",
   "bookmarks": [
    "NotDC-PS3 caiqueAICA",
    "nullDC4WiiU Wii U main"
   ],
